    "title": "Wood Nuts & Bolts Puzzle",
    "description": "Wood Nuts & Bolts Puzzle, a new free game that'll boost your IQ by unscrewing the wood nuts, puts your quiz-solving skills to the test! Become a pro at unscrewing nuts and bolts while enjoying the exciting journey ahead.\r\n\r\nKey Features of Wood Nuts & Bolts Puzzle:\r\n\r\n\u2022 Various Difficulty Levels: Dive into 300+ levels, from beginner to advanced, full of fresh challenges and brain-teasing puzzles to keep your mind sharp and the fun rolling\r\n\u2022 Hint System: Get friendly hints to solve tricky wood nuts and bolts puzzles.\r\n\u2022 10+ skins to customize wood nuts and bolts.\r\n\u2022 Leaderboard awaits! Compete globally to showcase your wood puzzle-solving prowess.\r\n\r\nReady to have some brainy fun? Download Wood Nuts & Bolts Puzzle for an awesome wood puzzle experience now\r\nFollow us on Facebook:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/woodnutpuzzle\r\nJoin Group with us:\r\nhttps://www.facebook.com/groups/woodnutspuzzle",
